// A minimal Populate carrier ([CR#701.36a]): "Populate" — choose a creature
// token you control, then create a token that's a copy of it. No canon-slice
// card carries populate (the copy grammar is brand new); isolates the keyword
// action's expansion (the `With(ChooseOne(creature-token-you-control),
// Create(1, Copy(...)))` shape) + graduation as a spell effect.
Normal(
    name: "Populate Test Spell",
    mana_cost: [Generic(1), Green],
    types: [Instant],
    abilities: [
        Spell(effect: Populate),
    ],
)
